# Fieldwork — scroll-driven studio landing page — rebuild command

Build ONE file, `index.html`, no framework, no build step. It is a complete, long landing page (≈7,760px tall at 1440×900) for an independent design studio called **Fieldwork**: a fixed nav, a rounded hero card filled by one uncropped meadow photo with a giant wordmark on the sky, a scroll-scrubbed manifesto, four stat cards, a dark services accordion, three full-height project cards that stack on top of each other while you scroll, a process "staircase" of black bars, a testimonial grid with a logo marquee, and a dark footer with a second giant wordmark. Smooth scroll (Lenis) and GSAP ScrollTrigger drive every motion. Everything below is exact: numbers, never adjectives. Page language: English (`<html lang="en">`).

**Libraries (pinned, nothing else):**
- GSAP 3.12.5 — `https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/gsap.min.js`
- ScrollTrigger 3.12.5 — `https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/ScrollTrigger.min.js`
- Lenis 1.1.13 — `https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/lenis@1.1.13/dist/lenis.min.js` (global `Lenis`)
- Font: Google Fonts `Inter Tight` weights **400, 500, 600** (`display=swap`), with the two `preconnect` links.

**Assets (Path A, hosted on Cloudflare R2).** Every photo lives under `https://assets.layerweb.com.br/fieldwork/`. Use the exact URLs in section 11. Do not download, rename, recompress, swap or hotlink anything else. There are no fonts or videos on R2; the font comes from Google Fonts.

**Authoritative code.** Appendix A at the end of this document is the exact production file. If prose and appendix ever disagree, the appendix wins. Reproduce it verbatim, then run the self-check (section 15).

