## 0. Global shell
- `<!doctype html><html lang="en">`, `<meta charset="utf-8">`, viewport `width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover`.
- `<title>Fieldwork — Independent Design Studio</title>` and an English meta description.
- Favicon: the Fieldwork icon (section 2) as an SVG data URI, fill `#121212`.
- `<link rel="preload" as="image">` for `hero-field.jpg`; the hero `<img>` has `fetchpriority="high"`. Every image below the fold has `loading="lazy"`.
- Reset: `box-sizing: border-box` on everything, zero margin/padding, `body { font: 14px/1.5 "Inter Tight", "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color #121212; background #fff; overflow-x: clip }`, `-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased`.
- Lenis CSS hooks: `html.lenis, html.lenis body { height: auto }` and `.lenis.lenis-smooth { scroll-behavior: auto !important }`.
- The page always starts at the top: `history.scrollRestoration = 'manual'`, `scrollTo(0,0)` at script start, and again on `load` (`lenis.scrollTo(0, {immediate: true})`) when there is no hash.
- One hidden SVG sprite at the top of `<body>` holds every icon and logo as a `<symbol>`; markup references them with `<use href="#id">`.

