## 3. Nav — PIXEL CONTRACT
- `position: fixed; height 64px; padding 0 28px`, flex space-between: brand · links · burger.
- Links 13px: About + Services + Work + Process + Testimonials. The `+` separators are 13px `#c6c6c6` with horizontal margin `clamp(18px, 3.4vw, 52px)`.
- Link hover: a text roll — the label slides up 100% of its own box and a copy (`::after content: attr(data-t)`) slides in from below, `.5s var(--ease)`. The `6px 2px` padding lives on the span and its `::after`, never on the clipped `<a>`, so no sliver of the old label stays visible. DO NOT put padding on the overflow-hidden link.
- Burger: 44×44 button, two 28×1.5px lines 6px apart; on hover the second line becomes 18px wide and shifts 10px right.
- After 40px of scroll: background `rgba(255,255,255,.78)` + `backdrop-filter: blur(14px)`. Scrolling down past 220px hides it (`translateY(-100%)`, .6s); scrolling up shows it.
- Links hide below 1100px (burger only).
- DO NOT give the nav a border or shadow. DO NOT use a pill-shaped nav.

## 4. Fullscreen menu
Dark panel (`#1a1a1b`), revealed with `clip-path: inset(0 0 100% 0) → inset(0)` in .9s `--ease`. Five links `clamp(44px, 8vw, 104px)`, tracking −.045em, each with a 12px index `01`–`05`; words slide up from `translateY(105%)`. Close button 44px circle, rotates 90° on hover. Esc closes it. Lenis stops while it is open. Clicking a link closes the menu, waits 350ms, then smooth-scrolls to the section.

## 5. Hero — PIXEL CONTRACT
- Card: margin `76px 12px 0`, radius 20, background `#e8e8e6`, `overflow: hidden; isolation: isolate`.
- Top row padding `clamp(22px, 2.6vw, 38px) var(--pad) 0`, flex space-between.
- **Wordmark**: each letter of `Fieldwork` is its own `.ch` span inside one `.mask` (`overflow hidden; padding .06em .02em .04em 0`), then the `®`. `aria-label="Fieldwork"` on the `<h1>`.
- **Aside** (300px wide, padding-top `clamp(10px,1.4vw,22px)`): crew row — avatar 26px (avatar-04), a 44×1px ink line, two overlapping avatars (avatar-01, avatar-02, −8px overlap, 2px ring in the hero grey), tag `[ Made to last ]` 10px uppercase tracking .06em; then the 13px/1.55 `#4b4b4b` paragraph, max-width 264px.
- **Media**: the photo is shown whole and uncropped: `inset: 0`, `z-index: -1`, `object-fit: cover` on a card whose `aspect-ratio` is `2000/1333` (the photo's own ratio), so nothing is cut off. DO NOT add any fade, mask or gradient on the top of the photo. Only a faint bottom shade `linear-gradient(to top, rgba(10,14,8,.38) 0%, rgba(10,14,8,0) 30%)` for the white trust text. No scroll or mouse parallax on the photo; it only eases from `scale 1.12` to `1` on entrance. The wordmark and hero copy sit directly on the sky in `#121212`.
- **Featured card** 236px wide, white, radius 16, padding `6px 6px 0`, shadow `0 24px 50px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.45)`. It auto-rotates through 3 items every **4200ms**: images cross-fade (opacity .8s, scale 1.08→1 in 1.4s), captions roll up (`translateY(100% → 0 → −100%)`, .7s). A 2px progress bar at the bottom fills with `scaleX 0→1` over the same 4200ms. Hover lifts the card 6px and turns the arrow button black, rotated 45°.
- DO NOT center the wordmark. DO NOT put the meadow behind the wordmark (it starts at 30% of the card height). DO NOT replace the mask fade with a hard edge.

