## 14. Motion
**Smooth scroll:** `new Lenis({ lerp: .09, smoothWheel: true })`, `lenis.on('scroll', ScrollTrigger.update)`, driven by `gsap.ticker` (`lenis.raf(t * 1000)`), `gsap.ticker.lagSmoothing(0)`. Anchor clicks use `lenis.scrollTo(target, { duration: 1.6, easing: t => 1 − (1 − t)^4 })`.

**Entrance timeline** (starts .15s after script, `expo.out`):
| t (s) | target | from → to | duration |
|---|---|---|---|
| 0 | hero card | `clip-path inset(6% 5% 6% 5% round 28px)` → `inset(0 round 20px)` | 1.5 |
| 0 | hero photo | `scale 1.12 → 1` | 2.2 |
| .35 | wordmark letters + ® | `yPercent 110 → 0`, stagger .045 | 1.3 |
| .6 | nav | `yPercent −100, opacity 0 → 0, 1` | 1.0 |
| .8 | aside + trust | `y 24, opacity 0 → 0, 1`, stagger .1 | 1.1 |
| 1.0 | crew line | `scaleX 0 → 1` | 1.0 |
| 1.05 | featured card | `x 60, opacity 0 → 0, 1` | 1.3 |

**Hero scroll (scrub, hero top→bottom leaves):** wordmark `yPercent −40, opacity .2`; aside `y −60`; featured card `y −50`.

**Section reveals:** `[data-reveal]` → `y 36, opacity 0` in 1.2s at `top 90%`. `[data-split]` headings are split into masked words → `yPercent 115 → 0`, stagger .05, at `top 88%`. Stat cards and testimonial columns use `ScrollTrigger.batch` (once).

## 15. Responsive
- **≥1101px**: everything above.
- **≤1100px**: nav links hidden; stats 2×2; testimonials 2 columns; section heads stack the label on its own row; statement spans all 12 columns; step cards 2×2; footer lead spans the full row.
- **≤900px**: hero `height auto; min-height 760px`, top row stacks (wordmark `clamp(64px,17vw,150px)`, aside full width), photo starts at 40%; services header stacks, rows become `1fr 40px` with the index on its own line and images below the copy when open; project cards hide the descriptor and stack the bottom row.
- **≤640px**: `--edge 8px`, `--pad 18px`; featured card hidden; statement 25px; stats 1 column, 210px tall; lanes 220px tall with 28px bars and 10px labels; steps and testimonials 1 column; project cards `height 100svh − 120px; min-height 520px`; footer stacks.
No horizontal page scroll at any width (`overflow-x: clip` on body).

## 16. Accessibility
- `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce`: Lenis is not created, no GSAP timelines run, numbers show their final value, statement words are ink from the start, marquees stop, CSS transitions/animations collapse to .001ms.
- Every content image has an English `alt`; decorative faces use `alt=""`. Buttons carry `aria-label`; accordion toggles keep `aria-expanded` in sync; the menu keeps `aria-hidden`/`aria-expanded` in sync.
- Touch devices (`hover: none` or `pointer: coarse`) never get the cursor bubble, magnetic buttons or mouse parallax.

